#       ⭐ biscuit: EVERY BRANCH MUST TERMINATE IN "measured free" OR "wait" — never in the door's own
#         judgement about whether a stranger's process looks important.
#         · cwd is a TEST worktree               -> CONTENTION, wait
#         · cwd is commonplace-serve-pin (serve) -> not contention
#         · cwd UNRECOGNISED                     -> ⛔ CONTENTION, WAIT
#         · /proc/<pid>/cwd UNREADABLE           -> ⛔ BLIND, WAIT, ask
